    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const newItems = $('Check Scraper Errors').all(); \nconst existingNews = $('Get Existing News').all(); \nconst cachedNews = $('Get Cache').all();\n\nconst existingUrls = new Set();\nif (existingNews && existingNews.length) {\n  existingNews.forEach(i => { if(i.json.url) existingUrls.add(i.json.url); });\n}\n\nconst cachedMap = new Map();\nif (cachedNews && cachedNews.length) {\n  cachedNews.forEach(i => {\n    if(i.json.url) cachedMap.set(i.json.url, i.json);\n  });\n}\n\nconst toProcess = [];\n\nfor (const item of newItems) {\n  let url = item.json.link || item.json.url;\n  \n  if (!url && item.json.body) {\n      url = item.json.body.url || (item.json.body.result && item.json.body.result.url);\n  }\n  \n  if (existingUrls.has(url)) continue;\n\n  if (cachedMap.has(url)) {\n      const cached = cachedMap.get(url);\n      item.json = {\n          ...item.json,\n          ...JSON.parse(cached.result_json || '{}'),\n          is_cached: true\n      };\n  } else {\n      item.json.is_cached = false;\n      const raw_text = item.json.content || item.json.description || item.json.summary || \"\";\n      let clean_text = raw_text;\n      const markers = [\"Most Popular Articles\", \"Latest comments\", \"Trade With A Regulated Broker\", \"View all comments\", \"More News\", \"Market Movers\"];\n      for (const m of markers) {\n          const idx = clean_text.indexOf(m);\n          if (idx > 200) clean_text = clean_text.substring(0, idx);\n      }\n\n      item.json.prompt_para_api = `### Role:\\nYou are a Senior Financial Analyst at a top Wall Street firm.\\n\\n### Task:\\nAnalyze the provided news content and output a STRICT JSON object.\\n\\n### EXECUTION STEPS (INTERNAL PROCESS):\\n1. **READ**: Read the entire news content carefully.\\n2. **INTERPRET**: mentally evaluate the financial implications, identifying key catalysts, risks, and market sentiment.\\n3. **GENERATE**: Populate the JSON fields based STRICTLY on your interpretation. Do not hallucinate data not present or implied by the text.\\n\\n### FIELD DEFINITIONS (CRITICAL):\\n1. **market_impact**: Explain specifically HOW this affects the asset price or sector. Don't just say \"it affects\". Mention volatility, trend reversal, or volume spikes. (Max 2 sentences, Spanish).\\n2. **sentiment**: The direct market mood implied by the text. BULLISH (Optimistic/Uptrend), BEARISH (Pessimistic/Downtrend), NEUTRAL (Ambiguous/Sideways).\\n3. **action**: Your professional recommendation. BUY (Positive catalyst), SELL (Negative catalyst), HOLD (Uncertainty/Wait), DISCARD (Irrelevant/Spam).\\n4. **investment_advice**: Concrete reasoning connecting the news to the Action. Why buy/sell? (Spanish).\\n\\n### CRITICAL INSTRUCTIONS:\\n1. **RELEVANCE CHECK**: If the content is strictly legal/procedural (like Form 8-K), spam, or has NO financial market relevance, set \"action\" to \"DISCARD\" and \"market_impact\" to \"IRRELEVANT\".\\n2. **NO MARKDOWN**: Output raw JSON only.\\n3. **LANGUAGE**: Output values in SPANISH where requested.\\n\\n### Content:\\n${clean_text}\\n\\n### Output Schema:\\n{\\n  \"title\": \"Spanish Title (Max 15 words)\",\\n  \"summary\": \"Concise summary in Spanish\",\\n  \"market_impact\": \"(MANDATORY) Analysis in Spanish based on definition above.\",\\n  \"sentiment\": \"BULLISH | BEARISH | NEUTRAL\",\\n  \"risk_level\": \"LOW | MEDIUM | HIGH\",\\n  \"action\": \"BUY | SELL | HOLD | DISCARD\",\\n  \"investment_advice\": {\\n    \"rating\": \"Buy/Hold/Sell\",\\n    \"reasoning\": \"Explanation in Spanish\"\\n  },\\n  \"image_prompt\": \"Futuristic financial illustration...\"\\n}`;\n      \n      item.json.metadata_para_api = {\n          url: url,\n          source_content: raw_text,\n          published_date: item.json.isoDate || item.json.pubDate || new Date().toISOString()\n      };\n  }\n  toProcess.push(item);\n}\n\nreturn toProcess;"
      },
